      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I'LBERIDIN'SHOTGUN (2) has put together back-to-back placings, the latest when 0.8 lengths away in second after he got a long way back in the run over 1400m at Echuca. Well placed, gets blinkers and there is no reason he cannot find winning ways. KARMA QUEEN (9) showed good early dash and raced on the speed last start before fading to finish one length back in fourth over 1200m at Murray Bridge. Tricky draw but has the talent to overcome that. CLASSIC CRACKER (7) resumed a week-and-a-half ago over 1175m at Albury and was only beaten 1.1 lengths into fourth. Meets some better types this time but can make amends. SPIDERMAN (5) is yet to break through after five career starts. Managed to fill a minor placing at Ballarat Synthetic two starts back before finishing 11th over 1200m at Ballarat Synthetic last start. Won't get too many better chances to open his account. MASSALIA (10) was terrible last start, but adequate on debut and should be better for those outings.",
